击\n消耗耐力，在空中进行连续攻击，造成热熔伤害。\n \n闪避反击\n成功闪避后一定时间内短按普攻，将会攻击目标，造成热熔伤害。","descEn":"Basic Attack\nMortefi uses his dual pistols and flames to perform up to 4 consecutive shots, dealing Fusion DMG.\n \nHeavy Attack\nMortefi enters the aiming state for a more powerful shot.\nThe aimed shot fired after charging finishes deals Fusion DMG.\n \nMid-air Attack\nMortefi consumes STA to perform consecutive shots at the target in mid-air, dealing Fusion DMG.\n \nDodge Counter\nUse Basic Attack after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing Fusion DMG.","params":[{"label":"第一段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 1 DMG","values":["24.29%","26.29%","28.28%","31.07%","33.06%","35.35%","38.54%","41.72%","44.91%","48.30%"]},{"label":"第二段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 2 DMG","values":["20.51%*2","22.20%*2","23.88%*2","26.23%*2","27.92%*2","29.85%*2","32.54%*2","35.23%*2","37.92%*2","40.78%*2"]},{"label":"第三段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 3 DMG","values":["53.97%","58.40%","62.83%","69.02%","73.45%","78.54%","85.62%","92.70%","99.78%","107.30%"]},{"label":"第四段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 4 DMG","values":["10.57%*4+63.84%","11.44%*4+69.08%","12.31%*4+74.31%","13.52%*4+81.64%","14.39%*4+86.88%","15.39%*4+92.90%","16.77%*4+101.27%","18.16%*4+109.65%","19.55%*4+118.03%","21.02%*4+126.93%"]},{"label":"瞄准伤害","labelEn":"Aimed Shot Damage","values":["49.14%","53.17%","57.20%","62.85%","66.87%","71.51%","77.96%","84.40%","90.85%","97.70%"]},{"label":"瞄准完全蓄力伤害","labelEn":"Fully Charged Aimed Shot Damage","values":["84.00%","90.89%","97.78%","107.42%","114.31%","122.23%","133.25%","144.27%","155.30%","167.01%"]},{"label":"空中攻击第一段伤害","labelEn":"Mid-air Attack Stage 1 DMG","values":["11.69%","12.65%","13.61%","14.95%","15.91%","17.02%","18.55%","20.08%","21.62%","23.25%"]},{"label":"空中攻击第二段伤害","labelEn":"Mid-air Attack Stage 2 DMG","values":["11.69%","12.65%","13.61%","14.95%","15.91%","17.02%","18.55%","20.08%","21.62%","23.25%"]},{"label":"闪避反击伤害","labelEn":"Dodge Counter DMG","values":["98.07%","106.12%","114.16%","125.42%","133.46%","